ndidate\\r\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\nphases/27-cantilever-slab\\step2-codex.stdout.log:90:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_46\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"\\\"C:\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\" -Command '$OutputEncoding=[Console]::OutputEncoding=[Text.UTF8Encoding]::new(); rg -n \\\"cantilever|片持\\\" phases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json docs/ADR.md docs/DESIGN.md docs/UX.md'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"phases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:2:  \\\"phase\\\": \\\"27-cantilever-slab\\\",\\nphases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:4:  \\\"name\\\": \\\"cantilever-domain-rulepack-golden\\\",\\nphases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:7:    \\\"fixture\\\": \\\"tests/golden/fixtures/quantity-r5-ch3.json#cases.cantileverSlab\\\",\\nphases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:28:    \\\"ruleInterpretation\\\": \\\"表5.3.4 L3 スラブ欄の片持スラブ例外は25dだけで、anchorage.L3.minimum の150mm行は片持条件で追加照会しない。\\\"\\nphases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:34:        \\\"conditions\\\": { \\\"member\\\": \\\"片持スラブ\\\" },\\nphases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:46:      \\\"anchorage.L3.minimum for 片持スラブ\\\"\\nphases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:50:    \\\"Member.cantilever is optional and valid only for a 床板 with GirderPosition; existing bay-position slabs remain valid and schemaVersion is unchanged.\\\",\\nphases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:51:    \\\"片持床板 uses one support 大梁 and both endpoint 柱 to derive support-edge 内法; missing or non-positive geometry throws MemberUnsupportedError('寸法不成立').\\\",\\nphases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:52:    \\\"片持床板 runs are always standalone; the parallel direction has no support and the projection direction has exactly one support according to side 正/負.\\\"\\nphases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:67:    \\\"phases/27-cantilever-slab/index.json\\\",\\nphases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:68:    \\\"phases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json\\\"\\nphases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:76:    \\\"targeted cantilever and rulepack tests\\\": {\\nphases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json:96:  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"片持床板のモデル・内法幾何・L3=25d/La の算定とゴールデン2件を追加し、schema互換性・不成立ガード・全ゲートを確認した。\\\"\\ndocs/ADR.md:325:| 片持スラブ | 表5.3.1 注1·表5.3.5 注1 | 2（４）床板2) 但書 | **만들지 않는다**(형상 입력이 없다) |\\r\\ndocs/ADR.md:348:- **片持床板** — 表5.3.4의 「（片持スラブの場合は25d）」도 表5.3.5 注1·注2의 但書도 원문에 있지만, 제품에 「한쪽만 지지된 床板」이라는 형상 입력이 없다. 형상을 먼저 받아야 값이 의미를 갖는다.\\r\\ndocs/ADR.md:557:### ADR-039: 片持床板을 만든다 — ADR-028의 「두 원문 0건」 전제는 틀렸다\\ndocs/ADR.md:559:**맥락**: ADR-028은 `片持床板`과 `配力筋`을 「두 원문 0건」으로 묶어 둘 다 만들지 않았고, 그 서술이 `CLAUDE.md`·`docs/MILESTONES.md`에 그대로 실려 있다. 원문을 다시 세어 보니 **0건인 것은 `配力筋`뿐이다** — 「片持」는 `数量積算基準`에 6건(PDF p15·16·21·22×2·25), `標準仕様書`에 8건(p33·36×2·37×4·60) 있고 그중 넷은 片持床板에 직접 걸린다. 근거를 갖고 있으면서 만들지 않은 것이므로 전제를 고치고 만든다.\\ndocs/ADR.md:562:- `数量積算基準` 第4編第1章第2節（４）床板 — 「片持床板等もこれらに準ずる。」 즉 片持도 「柱、梁等に接する水平材の内法部分」이다.\\ndocs/ADR.md:563:- 같은 기준 2（４）床板2) 但書 — 「単独床板及び片持床板の主筋の継手は、1通則4)による。」 連続床板의 区分表가 아니라 길이 기반이다.\\ndocs/ADR.md:564:- `標準仕様書` 表5.3.4 L3 スラブ欄 — 「10d かつ150mm以上（**片持スラブの場合は25d**）」. 下端筋 直線定着이 갈린다.\\ndocs/ADR.md:565:- 같은 표 5.3.5 注1·2 — La는 「基礎梁、片持梁及び**片持スラブを含む**」, Lb는 「片持小梁及び**片持スラブを除く**」. 上端筋 折曲げ定着의 投影 열이 Lb가 아니라 **La**다.\\ndocs/ADR.md:566:- 같은 표 5.3.1 注1 — 「**片持ちスラブ先端**、壁筋の自由端側の先端で90°フック又は135°フックを用いる場合には、余長は4d以上とする。」 원문이 片持의 先端과 壁의 自由端을 같은 자리에서 다룬다 — ADR-037이 벽에 세운 자유단 판단을 원문이 지지한다.\\ndocs/ADR.md:569:1. **부재를 늘리지 않는다** — `MemberKind`는 넷 그대로이고 片持床板은 `kind: '床板'`이다. 갈리는 것은 **지지 조건**이지 부재가 아니다(ADR-036이 雑壁을 区分으로 담은 것과 같은 형태).\\ndocs/ADR.md:570:2. **위치는 지지하는 辺이고, 내미는 치수는 設計図書 전사다** — 片持床板의 `position`은 ベイ가 아니라 支持辺(`GirderPosition` 형태)이고, `Member.cantilever?: { side: '正' | '負'; projectionMm: number }`가 내미는 쪽과 치수를 받는다(`正` ＝ 支持辺의 축에 직교하는 通り芯 index가 커지는 쪽). 조문은 内法 준용만 말하고 내미는 치수를 정하지 않으므로 전사 입력이다 — ADR-037과 같은 이유·같은 형태. `kind: '床板'`이면서 `axis`를 가진 position이 곧 片持이다. 스키마 버전은 올리지 않는다(optional 추가, 기존 案件 数量 불변).\\ndocs/ADR.md:573:5. **定着 값이 갈리는 두 곳** — 下端筋의 L3은 `片持スラブ` 조건으로 25d(＋같은 칸의 150mm 하한을 그대로 딸린다), 上端筋 折曲げ의 投影은 `Lb`가 아니라 `La`다. 5.3.4(5)(ｲ)(c)의 「柱せいの3/4以上」은 **끌어오지 않는다** — 그 하한이 재는 것은 柱せい인데 片持床板은 柱에 정착하지 않는다(제품의 읽기, R2). 룰팩 신규는 L3의 片持 행뿐이고 La는 기존 행을 그대로 조회한다.\\ndocs/ADR.md:574:6. **継手는 1通則4)다** — 2（４）床板2) 但書가 片持를 連続床板 区分表에서 빼므로, 13.5m 상한의 `継手箇所数不明`(ADR-028)에 걸리지 않는다.\\ndocs/ADR.md:575:7. **하지 않는 것**: 断面リスト 파서의 片持スラブリスト 대응(전사 픽스처가 「値は転写省略」이라 골든이 설 자리가 없다 — 재전사가 선결이다), 先端筋·開口補強筋 이외의 補強筋(2（４）床板1)이 設計図書에 위임), 부분 폭 片持, 片持梁·片持小梁(小梁은 ADR-005로 만들지 않는다), 表5.3.1 注1의 4d 余長(加工 형상이고 数量은 1通則1)로 정해진다 — R12와 같은 자리에 둔다).\\ndocs/ADR.md:577:**2026-08-27 정정 (phase 27 step 0의 반증을 받아들임)**: §5의 「25d(＋같은 칸의 150mm 하한을 그대로 딸린다)」는 틀렸다. `表5.3.4`의 L3 スラブ欄은 세로로 병합된 **단일 셀**이고, 그 셀 안의 span 배치가 「10d」(y=265) → 「150mm」(y=293) → 「（片持」(y=336) → 「は25d）」(y=377) 순이므로 괄호는 「10d」만이 아니라 **「10d かつ150mm以上」 전체의 예외값**이다. 따라서 片持スラブ의 L3은 **25d 하나이고 150mm 하한은 딸리지 않는다.** 룰팩에도 片持용 `anchorage.L3.minimum` 행을 만들지 않고, 조회 시 그 행을 끌어오지도 않는다. 이 정정은 값을 바꾸지 않는다 — 제품이 다루는 가장 가는 径이 D10이라 25d ＝ 250mm ＞ 150mm이고, 두 읽기가 모든 径에서 같은 수를 낸다. 그래도 고치는 이유는 근거의 문면이 다르기 때문이다.\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\nphases/27-cantilever-slab\\step2-codex.stdout.log:91:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_45\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"\\\"C:\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\" -Command '$OutputEncoding=[Console]::OutputEncoding=[Text.UTF8Encoding]::new(); $p='\\\"'phases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json'; \\\"'$l=Get-Content -Encoding UTF8 $p; $l[1..220]'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"  \\\"phase\\\": \\\"27-cantilever-slab\\\",\\r\\n  \\\"step\\\": 1,\\r\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"cantilever-domain-rulepack-golden\\\",\\r\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\r\\n  \\\"golden\\\": {\\r\\n    \\\"fixture\\\": \\\"tests/golden/fixtures/quantity-r5-ch3.json#cases.cantileverSlab\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"cases\\\": [\\r\\n      {\\r\\n        \\\"id\\\": \\\"positive-short\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"derivation\\\": \\\"支持辺 X の内法 5200。X方向と平行な筋は定着0回、割付は projection 1800 の10本。直交Y方向は27本で、下端は支持辺の L3=25d=325 の1回だけを加えて2125、上端は折曲げで投影Laを使い全長のL1=520が支配して2320。自由端は1通則1)で加算0、継手は1通則4)で0か所。\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"designQuantitiesKg\\\": {\\r\\n          \\\"projectionBottom\\\": 57.375,\\r\\n          \\\"projectionTop\\\": 62.64,\\r\\n          \\\"parallelBottom\\\": 52\\r\\n        }\\r\\n      },\\r\\n      {\\r\\n        \\\"id\\\": \\\"negative-long\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"derivation\\\": \\\"支持辺 X の内法 5200。負方向では支持辺がYラン終端となり、下端・上端とも支持辺側の定着1回だけ、自由端の加算は0。下端は7000+25d(325)+1通則4)の継手520=7845、上端は7000+Laを含む折曲げでL1=520が支配し、継手520を加えて8040。Y方向の割付は27本、平行X方向は7000幅への36本で継手0か所。\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"designQuantitiesKg\\\": {\\r\\n          \\\"projectionBottom\\\": 211.815,\\r\\n          \\\"projectionTop\\\": 217.08,\\r\\n          \\\"parallelBottom\\\": 187.2\\r\\n        }\\r\\n      }\\r\\n    ],\\r\\n    \\\"ruleInterpretation\\\": \\\"表5.3.4 L3 スラブ欄の片持スラブ例外は25dだけで、anchorage.L3.minimum の150mm行は片持条件で追加照会しない。\\\"\\r\\n  },\\r\\n  \\\"rulepack\\\": {\\r\\n    \\\"added\\\": [\\r\\n      {\\r\\n        \\\"key\\\": \\\"anchorage.L3\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"conditions\\\": { \\\"member\\\": \\\"片持スラブ\\\" },\\r\\n        \\\"value\\\": 25,\\r\\n        \\\"unit\\\": \\\"d\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"source\\\": \\\"表5.3.4 printedPage 30\\\",\\r\\n        \\\"confidence\\\": \\\"transcribed\\\"\\r\\n      }\\r\\n    ],\\r\\n    \\\"unchangedLookups\\\": [\\r\\n      \\\"anchorage.La\\\",\\r\\n      \\\"measure.tip.length.addition\\\"\\r\\n    ],\\r\\n    \\\"notAdded\\\": [\\r\\n      \\\"anchorage.L3.minimum for 片持スラブ\\\"\\r\\n    ]\\r\\n  },\\r\\n  \\\"modelAndGeometry\\\": [\\r\\n    \\\"Member.cantilever is optional and valid only for a 床板 with GirderPosition; existing bay-position slabs remain valid and schemaVersion is unchanged.\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"片持床板 uses one support 大梁 and both endpoint 柱 to derive support-edge 内法; missing or non-positive geometry throws MemberUnsupportedError('寸法不成立').\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"片持床板 runs are always standalone; the parallel direction has no support and the projection direction has exactly one support according to side 正/負.\\\"\\r\\n  ],\\r\\n  \\\"changedFiles\\\": [\\r\\n    \\\"src/domain/model/member.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"src/domain/model/project.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"src/domain/model/project.test.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"src/domain/rebar/slab-ends.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"src/domain/rebar/slab.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"src/rulepack/jp-mlit/anchorage.yaml\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"tests/golden/fixtures/quantity-r5-ch3.json\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"tests/golden/fixtures/spec-r7-ch5.json\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"tests/golden/quantity-measurement.test.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"tests/golden/rulepack-invariants.test.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"tests/golden/spec-fixture.test.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"tests/golden/spec-tables.test.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"phases/27-cantilever-slab/index.json\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"phases/27-cantilever-slab/step1-report.json\\\"\\r\\n  ],\\r\\n  \\\"constraints\\\": [\\r\\n    \\\"src/components/**, src/lib/viewer/**, and src/lib/import/** were not modified.\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"MemberKind and schemaVersion were not changed.\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"The previous failed-attempt logs and invocation record were retained.\\\"\\r\\n  ],\\r\\n  \\\"gates\\\": {\\r\\n    \\\"targeted cantilever and rulepack tests\\\": {\\r\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"passed\\\",\\r\\n      \\\"testFiles\\\": 5,\\r\\n      \\\"tests\\\": 476\\r\\n    },\\r\\n    \\\"npm run test\\\": {\\r\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"passed\\\",\\r\\n      \\\"testFiles\\\": 83,\\r\\n      \\\"tests\\\": 1573\\r\\n    },\\r\\n    \\\"npx tsc --noEmit\\\": {\\r\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"passed\\\"\\r\\n    },\\r\\n    \\\"npm run lint\\\": {\\r\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"passed\\\",\\r\\n      \\\"errors\\\": 0,\\r\\n      \\\"warnings\\\": 1,\\r\\n      \\\"warning\\\": \\\"pre-existing src/app/api/oncall/alert/route.test.ts:161 (_omitted unused)\\\"\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  },\\r\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"片持床板のモデル・内法幾何・L3=25d/La の算定とゴールデン2件を追加し、schema互換性・不成立ガード・全ゲートを確認した。\\\"\\r\\n}\\r\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\nphases/27-cantilever-slab\\step2-codex.stdout.log:97:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_49\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"\\\"C:\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\" -Command '$OutputEncoding=[Console]::OutputEncoding=[Text.UTF8Encoding]::new(); $p='\\\"'src/domain/model/project.ts'; \\\"'$l=Get-Content -Encoding UTF8 $p; $l[200..350]; $l[850..1010]'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"  耐震壁: 'W',\\r\\n  床板: 'S',\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nfunction isColumnPosition(\\r\\n  position: ColumnPosition | GirderPosition,\\r\\n): position is ColumnPosition {\\r\\n  return !('axis' in position)\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nfunction isGirderPosition(\\r\\n  position: ColumnPosition | GirderPosition,\\r\\n): position is GirderPosition {\\r\\n  return 'axis' in position\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nfunction isGridEdgePosition(\\r\\n  grid: Grid,\\r\\n  position: GirderPosition,\\r\\n): boolean {\\r\\n  const { nx, ny } = gridPointCount(grid)\\r\\n\\r\\n  if (position.axis !== 'X' && position.axis !== 'Y') return false\\r\\n\\r\\n  return (\\r\\n    Number.isInteger(position.ix) &&\\r\\n    Number.isInteger(position.iy) &&\\r\\n    position.ix >= 0 &&\\r\\n    position.iy >= 0 &&\\r\\n    (position.axis === 'X'\\r\\n      ? position.ix < nx - 1 && position.iy < ny\\r\\n      : position.ix < nx && position.iy < ny - 1)\\r\\n  )\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nfunction columnAt(\\r\\n  project: Project,\\r\\n  storyId: string,\\r\\n  ix: number,\\r\\n  iy: number,\\r\\n): Member | undefined {\\r\\n  return project.members.find(\\r\\n    (candidate) =>\\r\\n      candidate.kind === '柱' &&\\r\\n      candidate.storyId === storyId &&\\r\\n      isColumnPosition(candidate.position) &&\\r\\n      candidate.position.ix === ix &&\\r\\n      candidate.position.iy === iy,\\r\\n  )\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nfunction girderAt(\\r\\n  project: Project,\\r\\n  storyId: string,\\r\\n  position: GirderPosition,\\r\\n): Member | undefined {\\r\\n  return project.members.find(\\r\\n    (candidate) =>\\r\\n      candidate.kind === '大梁' &&\\r\\n      candidate.storyId === storyId &&\\r\\n      isGirderPosition(candidate.position) &&\\r\\n      candidate.position.axis === position.axis &&\\r\\n      candidate.position.ix === position.ix &&\\r\\n      candidate.position.iy === position.iy,\\r\\n  )\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nfunction sectionHasKind(\\r\\n  project: Project,\\r\\n  member: Member | undefined,\\r\\n  kind: MemberKind,\\r\\n): boolean {\\r\\n  if (member === undefined) return false\\r\\n  return project.sections.some(\\r\\n    (section) => section.id === member.sectionId && section.kind === kind,\\r\\n  )\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n/**\\r\\n * 壁を置いたときに wallSpan が内法を決められるかを判定する。\\r\\n *\\r\\n * 既存の部材の有無や符号は見ない。符号から作る id の重複は配置操作側の\\r\\n * 責務であり、別の符号の壁を同じ辺に置くことをここで禁じない (ADR-038)。\\r\\n */\\r\\nexport function canPlaceWall(\\r\\n  project: Project,\\r\\n  storyId: string,\\r\\n  position: GirderPosition,\\r\\n): boolean {\\r\\n  if (!isGridEdgePosition(project.grid, position)) return false\\r\\n\\r\\n  const story = project.stories.find(({ id }) => id === storyId)\\r\\n  const endIx = position.axis === 'X' ? position.ix + 1 : position.ix\\r\\n  const endIy = position.axis === 'Y' ? position.iy + 1 : position.iy\\r\\n  const startColumn = columnAt(project, storyId, position.ix, position.iy)\\r\\n  const endColumn = columnAt(project, storyId, endIx, endIy)\\r\\n  const upperGirder = girderAt(project, storyId, position)\\r\\n\\r\\n  if (\\r\\n    story === undefined ||\\r\\n    startColumn === undefined ||\\r\\n    endColumn === undefined ||\\r\\n    upperGirder === undefined ||\\r\\n    !sectionHasKind(project, startColumn, '柱') ||\\r\\n    !sectionHasKind(project, endColumn, '柱') ||\\r\\n    !sectionHasKind(project, upperGirder, '大梁')\\r\\n  ) {\\r\\n    return false\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  const startSection = project.sections.find(\\r\\n    (section) => section.id === startColumn.sectionId,\\r\\n  )\\r\\n  const endSection = project.sections.find(\\r\\n    (section) => section.id === endColumn.sectionId,\\r\\n  )\\r\\n  const upperSection = project.sections.find(\\r\\n    (section) => section.id === upperGirder.sectionId,\\r\\n  )\\r\\n  if (\\r\\n    startSection?.kind !== '柱' ||\\r\\n    endSection?.kind !== '柱' ||\\r\\n    upperSection?.kind !== '大梁'\\r\\n  ) {\\r\\n    return false\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  const startPoint = gridPoint(project.grid, position.ix, position.iy)\\r\\n  const endPoint = gridPoint(project.grid, endIx, endIy)\\r\\n  const centerSpan =\\r\\n    position.axis === 'X'\\r\\n      ? endPoint.x - startPoint.x\\r\\n      : endPoint.y - startPoint.y\\r\\n  const startSupportLength =\\r\\n    position.axis === 'X' ? startSection.b : startSection.d\\r\\n  const endSupportLength =\\r\\n    position.axis === 'X' ? endSection.b : endSection.d\\r\\n  const clearLength =\\r\\n    centerSpan - startSupportLength / 2 - endSupportLength / 2\\r\\n  const clearHeight = story.height - upperSection.depth\\r\\n\\r\\n  return clearLength > 0 && clearHeight > 0\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n/**\\r\\n * 지정한 階에서 실제 내법을 계산할 수 있는 벽 辺 후보를 반환한다.\\r\\n * 반환값은 기하 후보이며, 같은 符号로 만든 id 중복은 이 함수에서 판정하지 않는다.\\r\\n */\\r\\nexport function placeableWallPositions(\\r\\n  project: Project,\\r\\n  storyId: string,\\r\\n * と定めるので、測るのは通り芯間ではなく大梁の内側面の間である。柱・大梁と\\r\\n * 二重計上しないのはこの定義そのもので、大梁が内法長さ・壁が内法部分なのと同じ形だ。\\r\\n */\\r\\nexport interface SlabBay {\\r\\n  /** 通り芯間スパン (mm) */\\r\\n  centerSpanXMm: number\\r\\n  centerSpanYMm: number\\r\\n  /** 内法長さ (mm) — X方向は両側の Y通り大梁の内側面の間 */\\r\\n  clearXMm: number\\r\\n  clearYMm: number\\r\\n  /** ベイ原点の格子点から内法域の原点までの距離 (mm) ＝ 受ける大梁幅の1/2 */\\r\\n  startFaceOffsetXMm: number\\r\\n  startFaceOffsetYMm: number\\r\\n  /** 四辺で受ける大梁。X方向の内法を決めるのは minX・maxX（Y通り大梁）である */\\r\\n  supports: {\\r\\n    minX: SlabEdgeSupport\\r\\n    maxX: SlabEdgeSupport\\r\\n    minY: SlabEdgeSupport\\r\\n    maxY: SlabEdgeSupport\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n/** 床板筋が定着していく先の大梁1本。 */\\r\\nexport interface SlabEdgeSupport {\\r\\n  memberId: string\\r\\n  /** 大梁の幅 b (mm) — 床板筋はこの中へ定着する */\\r\\n  widthMm: number\\r\\n  /** 定着が納まるかの判定は支点（大梁）のかぶりで行う — 床板のものではない */\\r\\n  cover: Record<string, string | boolean>\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nexport interface SlabCantileverRun {\\r\\n  supportAxis: 'X' | 'Y'\\r\\n  side: CantileverSlab['side']\\r\\n  supportAt: 'start' | 'end' | 'none'\\r\\n  support: SlabEdgeSupport\\r\\n  supportClearMm: number\\r\\n  projectionMm: number\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nfunction isSlabPosition(\\r\\n  position: ColumnPosition | GirderPosition,\\r\\n): position is SlabPosition {\\r\\n  return !('axis' in position)\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nfunction girderSectionAt(\\r\\n  project: Project,\\r\\n  storyId: string,\\r\\n  axis: 'X' | 'Y',\\r\\n  ix: number,\\r\\n  iy: number,\\r\\n  requestedBy: Member,\\r\\n): { member: Member; section: GirderSection } {\\r\\n  const girder = project.members.find(\\r\\n    (candidate) =>\\r\\n      candidate.kind === '大梁' &&\\r\\n      candidate.storyId === storyId &&\\r\\n      isGirderPosition(candidate.position) &&\\r\\n      candidate.position.axis === axis &&\\r\\n      candidate.position.ix === ix &&\\r\\n      candidate.position.iy === iy,\\r\\n  )\\r\\n\\r\\n  // 四辺のどれかが欠けると内法が決まらない。通り芯間で代用すれば大梁と重なった\\r\\n  // 床板を計上してしまうので、黙って埋めない — 壁の上部大梁と同じ扱いである。\\r\\n  if (!girder) {\\r\\n    throw new MemberUnsupportedError(\\r\\n      '寸法不成立',\\r\\n      `Missing ${axis}通り大梁 beside 床板: ${requestedBy.id} (${ix}, ${iy})`,\\r\\n    )\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  const section = findSection(project, girder.sectionId)\\r\\n  if (section.kind !== '大梁') {\\r\\n    throw new MemberUnsupportedError(\\r\\n      '寸法不成立',\\r\\n      `大梁 member references a non-大梁 section: ${girder.id}`,\\r\\n    )\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  return { member: girder, section }\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nexport function slabBay(project: Project, member: Member): SlabBay {\\r\\n  if (member.kind !== '床板') {\\r\\n    throw new Error(`slabBay requires a 床板: ${member.id}`)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  if (!isSlabPosition(member.position)) {\\r\\n    throw new MemberUnsupportedError(\\r\\n      '寸法不成立',\\r\\n      `slabBay requires a ベイ position for 床板: ${member.id}`,\\r\\n    )\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  const { ix, iy } = member.position\\r\\n  const origin = gridPoint(project.grid, ix, iy)\\r\\n  const far = gridPoint(project.grid, ix + 1, iy + 1)\\r\\n\\r\\n  const edge = (\\r\\n    axis: 'X' | 'Y',\\r\\n    edgeIx: number,\\r\\n    edgeIy: number,\\r\\n  ): SlabEdgeSupport => {\\r\\n    const { member: girder, section } = girderSectionAt(\\r\\n      project,\\r\\n      member.storyId,\\r\\n      axis,\\r\\n      edgeIx,\\r\\n      edgeIy,\\r\\n      member,\\r\\n    )\\r\\n    return {\\r\\n      memberId: girder.id,\\r\\n      widthMm: section.b,\\r\\n      cover: coverConditions(section),\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  // X方向の内法を決めるのは Y通り（縦に走る）大梁の幅である — 走る向きと\\r\\n  // 幅を測る向きが直交するので、ここを取り違えると内法が入れ替わる。\\r\\n  const supports = {\\r\\n    minX: edge('Y', ix, iy),\\r\\n    maxX: edge('Y', ix + 1, iy),\\r\\n    minY: edge('X', ix, iy),\\r\\n    maxY: edge('X', ix, iy + 1),\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  const centerSpanXMm = far.x - origin.x\\r\\n  const centerSpanYMm = far.y - origin.y\\r\\n  const startFaceOffsetXMm = supports.minX.widthMm / 2\\r\\n  const startFaceOffsetYMm = supports.minY.widthMm / 2\\r\\n  const clearXMm =\\r\\n    centerSpanXMm - startFaceOffsetXMm - supports.maxX.widthMm / 2\\r\\n  const clearYMm =\\r\\n    centerSpanYMm - startFaceOffsetYMm - supports.maxY.widthMm / 2\\r\\n\\r\\n  if (clearXMm <= 0 || clearYMm <= 0) {\\r\\n    throw new MemberUnsupportedError(\\r\\n      '寸法不成立',\\r\\n      `床板 内法長さ must be positive: ${member.id} ` +\\r\\n        `(X ${clearXMm} mm, Y ${clearYMm} mm)`,\\r\\n    )\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  return {\\r\\n    centerSpanXMm,\\r\\n    centerSpanYMm,\\r\\n    clearXMm,\\r\\n    clearYMm,\\r\\n    startFaceOffsetXMm,\\r\\n    startFaceOffsetYMm,\\r\\n    supports,\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n/**\\r\\n * 同一断面の床板が大梁を通して連なる範囲 — 数量積算基準 2（４）床板1) の\\r\\n * 「同一の径の主筋が梁、壁等を通して連続する場合」がこれである。\\r\\n *\\r\\n * 大梁のラン (girderRun) と同じ形だ。1ベイなら長さ1のランで「単独床板」、\\r\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\nphases/27-cantilever-slab\\step2-codex.stdout.log:99:{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_50\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"\\\"C:\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\" -Command '$OutputEncoding=[Console]::OutputEncoding=[Text.UTF8Encoding]::new(); rg -n \\\"support width|support edge|支持辺|supportClear|projection\\\" phases/27-cantilever-slab tests/golden src/domain/rebar/slab.test.ts src/domain/rebar/slab-ends.test.ts'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
